{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"想起从前两个人相处时那份亲密和温柔，他有一阵真盼着日子还能这样过。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可想到当初是为不再一味忍着才走，他又怀疑走得对不对，也说不清自己后不后悔；没走，如今又会怎样？\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"只修改S04。该段被三次独立比较点到，均指出旧日归属与当初离开的决定之间联系不够紧，因此达到修改条件。第一条把原来较泛的“一切还能照从前那样继续”落到两个人相处时的亲密和温柔，让幸福本身有了具体的关系质地；第二条把当初不愿继续忍让的原因带回来，使对旧日生活的向往直接牵出对离开是否正确的怀疑，同时保留后悔未定和假如没有离开的追问。没有重复增加一轮想念或害怕。S03、S05、S12各只有一位读者提出意见，未达到至少两位读者共同指出才修改的条件，因此保留原文。另，珠子支持亲密、柔情和短暂幸福，但没有充分证据证明双方互相需要，故不把这一推测写成确定事实。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "53a95ed0-b7f3-4f85-848c-4589d496f608", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T161033263653Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:11:52.690693+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "114cce533da273bd7b4f0aa693474fc2a3b245593826bc140b7d614e405d48ce", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7f